 noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:d56310f5-be71-4e64-8ec9-2ba97beb98d8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by a <a href=\"/wiki/Flaming_Fist\" title=\"Flaming Fist\">Flaming Fist</a> mercenary at <a href=\"/wiki/Waukeen%27s_Rest\" title=\"Waukeen's Rest\">Waukeen's Rest</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-48&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;599</span></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Hey idiot,\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>You left a snot rag on my kitchen table. I haven't thrown it out yet.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>A lot of times I want to push you into a pit of snakes. But sometimes you say something so stupid and funny I think about it for days.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Don't panic. Let's talk when you're home. Be safe out there.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Rhea\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715042248\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1617/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27136/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6314/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 2/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 936175/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   47.313      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   47.313      1 -total\n 51.17%   24.210      7 Template:Icon_text\n 45.89%   21.711     